external_plugins/telegram), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The files under plugins/telegram/ outside plugins/telegram/extensions/ are a
copy of upstream version 0.0.7, with four changes: plugins/telegram/server.ts
carries a small patch that calls the code in plugins/telegram/extensions/,
plugins/telegram/skills/configure/SKILL.md is rewritten so the bot token is
never saved through Claude, the version in
plugins/telegram/.claude-plugin/plugin.json and plugins/telegram/package.json
follows the version of this project, and plugins/telegram/bun.lock is resolved
again within the ranges of plugins/telegram/package.json, so no dependency
carries a known high or critical advisory. Every other upstream file is
unchanged.
